ze-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">・<ruby>鈴花<rt>すずはな</rt></ruby>さんのお<ruby>誕生<rt>たんじょう</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>び</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\">(1/18)</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">・おもてなし<ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\">1</span><span class=\"s4\"><ruby>日<rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby>目<rt>め</rt></ruby><ruby>当日<rt>とうじつ</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\">(2/11)</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">・<ruby>巨人<rt>きょじん</rt></ruby>の<ruby>開幕<rt>かいまく</rt></ruby><ruby>戦<rt>せん</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\">(<span dir=\"ltr\">3/31</span>)</span><span class=\"s6\">◀︎</span><span class=\"s5\">🆕</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\">などなど、、</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\"><ruby>本日<rt>ほんじつ</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\"><span dir=\"ltr\">18:15</span></span><span class=\"s4\">から<ruby>巨人<rt>きょじん</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s3\">vs</span><span class=\"s4\"><ruby>中日<rt>ちゅうにち</rt></ruby>です</span><span class=\"s5\">‼️</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\"><ruby>遂<rt>つい</rt></ruby>に<ruby>開幕<rt>かいまく</rt></ruby>ですよ！！！！！！</span></p><p class=\"p4\"